  Title: The Big Bad Wolf
  Description: Whenever an ally dies, summon a crow.
  FlavorText: '"Wherever I go death, destruction, and devastation follow. That is
    my fate, and I cannot abide any other. I know not of dreams and what is not,
    only of what is. What is, is what I must preserve. Nothing more."'
